242
00:17:42,120 --> 00:17:45,980
It's the burning process that increases the toxicity of the chemicals in cigarettes.

243
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:50,820
When you burn any organic material like tobacco,

244
00:17:50,821 --> 00:17:55,060
