245
00:17:55,940 --> 00:17:57,940
These are classically talked about as tar.

246
00:17:58,460 --> 00:18:03,400
Two main classes of cancer-causing chemicals are the polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons

247
00:18:03,401 --> 00:18:05,620
and the nitrosamines.

248
00:18:06,220 --> 00:18:09,280
Both of those classes of drugs can damage DNA

249
00:18:09,281 --> 00:18:13,600
in such a way that it alters the control of cell growth.

250
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:17,660
And then when you see uncontrolled cell growth, you then see cancers develop.

251
00:18:17,661 --> 00:18:22,880
In all, more than 4,000 chemicals enter the lungs when a smoker inhales.

252
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:30,300
